&lt;h4&gt;Position Overview&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an experienced and highly skilled&amp;nbsp;Senior IT Infrastructure Engineer&amp;nbsp;to design, implement, and maintain our organization’s critical IT infrastructure. In this role, you will oversee servers, networking hardware, virtualization platforms, and storage solutions while ensuring high performance, security, and reliability. You will also play a key role in strategic IT planning, system optimization, and ensuring compliance with organizational SLAs.&lt;/p&gt;
